{"id":"vod_sn_37699","vodId":"37699","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"山林小猎人","name_cn":"山林小猎人","date":"1996-01-01","year":"1996","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/606ac8062106a39a70481a3b7118d7ea.jpg"},"summary":"顽皮的原始人--小刚随父母在野外生活，一个偶然的机会，他和可爱的大猩猩成了形影不离的好朋友。为了使小刚成为真正的原始人，一家人历经磨难，他们于北极历险、与凶猛的长毛象展开撕杀、遭遇飞碟、感受地狱之旅、拯救美人鱼……。同时，一家人也曾尝试农耕生活，甚至搬到了天上，但最终还是觉得原始生活最适合他们。在森林勇士大猩猩的帮助下魔难被一一战胜，顽皮的小刚也成长为一名真正的山林小猎人并得到了可爱的阿波的青睐","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/E0hxLNfZfK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/FEWhTzrSnE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/YUpu71S8Pt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/B30bbRsTQA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/c5kqvE9XqD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XMSk1GVuU21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mDTtNsKmk01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BUmwd6pmQh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EstpCHj7ng1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3geiLS8hi21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EJv1LAy7ED1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WRgcdZ5J7h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tEGiYcqrks1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/99Lm7cf0eM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/RRV3c8nhNE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","u